    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Yesterday, Mia and Tom went to the park. It was a sunny day, so they were very {{excited}}.",
      "scene": { "background": "park", "items": [
        { "sprite": "Girl", "x": 35, "y": 70, "scale": 1.1 },
        { "sprite": "Boy", "x": 58, "y": 70, "scale": 1.1 },
        { "sprite": "Sun", "x": 85, "y": 15, "scale": 1 },
        { "sprite": "Tree", "x": 12, "y": 50, "scale": 1.1 }
      ]},
      "vocab": [
        { "word": "excited", "definition": "Feeling very happy and full of energy about something." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "First, they played with a red ball under a big tree. Tom kicked the ball, and it flew over the {{fence}}!",
      "scene": { "background": "park", "items": [
        { "sprite": "Boy", "x": 40, "y": 72, "scale": 1.1 },
        { "sprite": "Ball", "x": 65, "y": 55, "scale": 0.8 },
        { "sprite": "Tree", "x": 15, "y": 50, "scale": 1.2 },
        { "sprite": "Fence", "x": 78, "y": 78, "scale": 1 }
      ]},
      "vocab": [
        { "word": "fence", "definition": "A wall made of wood or metal around a garden or field." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Mia {{climbed}} over the fence to find the ball. She found it next to some yellow flowers.",
      "scene": { "background": "park", "items": [
        { "sprite": "Girl", "x": 45, "y": 68, "scale": 1.1 },
        { "sprite": "Fence", "x": 60, "y": 75, "scale": 1 },
        { "sprite": "Flower", "x": 78, "y": 84, "scale": 1 },
        { "sprite": "Ball", "x": 82, "y": 80, "scale": 0.7 }
      ]},
      "vocab": [
        { "word": "climbed", "definition": "Went up or over something using your hands and feet." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Then, they sat on a bench and ate their lunch. They had {{sandwiches}} and juice.",
      "scene": { "background": "park", "items": [
        { "sprite": "Girl", "x": 35, "y": 68, "scale": 1 },
        { "sprite": "Boy", "x": 55, "y": 68, "scale": 1 },
        { "sprite": "Bench", "x": 45, "y": 78, "scale": 1.3 }
      ]},
      "vocab": [
        { "word": "sandwiches", "definition": "Food made of bread with something tasty inside." },
        { "word": "lunch", "definition": "A meal you eat in the middle of the day." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "A little dog came near them. It wanted a {{piece}} of their sandwich! Mia gave it a small piece.",
      "scene": { "background": "park", "items": [
        { "sprite": "Girl", "x": 30, "y": 70, "scale": 1 },
        { "sprite": "Boy", "x": 50, "y": 70, "scale": 1 },
        { "sprite": "Bench", "x": 40, "y": 78, "scale": 1.2 },
        { "sprite": "Dog", "x": 72, "y": 82, "scale": 0.9 }
      ]},
      "vocab": [
        { "word": "piece", "definition": "A small part of something." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Before they went home, Mia and Tom watched the clouds and talked about their {{favorite}} animals. It was a {{wonderful}} day.",
